ree) than did those who were unvaccinated (one)\"}]}], \"study_design\": [{\"v\": \"outbreak investigation\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"During May 4–August 17, 2023, a total of 56 laboratory-confirmed mpox cases occurred in Los Angeles County\"}]}, {\"v\": \"before/after or trend\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"In contrast, during the 3 months preceding May 4, 2023, only seven mpox cases were reported in LAC.\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Full vaccination was defined as receipt of ≥2 doses of JYNNEOS vaccine ≥24 days apart\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"based on illness onset date or laboratory specimen collection date (if onset date was missing)\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"the number of sex partners for whom information is sufficient to initiate contact efforts divided by the number of persons interviewed\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}